父亲","en":"Father"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10952","code":"0"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI107915","name":{"zh":"汝南许氏","en":"The Xu clan of Runan"},"years":["0","999"],"desc":{"zh":"出自炎帝之后。汉代许德由高阳迁居汝南平舆，开基立业。东汉顺帝时祖孙三世三公，为顶级文化士族。东汉至魏晋顶级文化士族，祖孙三世三公。许劭创‘月旦评’，品评天下人物，评曹操‘治世之能臣，乱世之奸雄’。许靖入蜀为太傅，位列蜀汉文臣之首。为汉末人物品评与士风塑造之核心家族。","en":"Descended from the Flame Emperor. In the Han dynasty, Xu De moved from Gaoyang to Pingyu in Runan to establish the clan's foundation. During the reign of Emperor Shun in the Eastern Han, three successive generations attained the rank of the Three Excellencies, establishing them as an elite cultural gentry clan. From the Eastern Han through the Wei and Jin dynasties, they remained a top-tier cultural gentry clan with three successive generations of the Three Excellencies. Xu Shao established the 'Monthly Critique' to evaluate figures across the realm, famously appraising Cao Cao as 'an able minister in times of peace, a crafty hero in times of chaos.' Xu Jing entered Shu to serve as Grand Tutor, ranking first among the civil officials of Shu Han. They were a pivotal Family in evaluating personalities and shaping scholar-gentry customs in the late Han."},"talent":{"military":"1","commerce":"3","politics":"7"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":{"name":"许混","height":"平均","shape":"一般"},"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[8,23,65,71,57,62],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1026905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10215","name":{"zh":"汉末三杰","en":"Three Heroes of the Late Han"},"year":"185","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role